      "message": "Yes, we need to delay the power button, which happens in the power button task, so adding delay in chipset task would not help.\n\nInstead of adding a delay in chipset_exit_hard_off() I think I\u0027ll try adding the delay into set_pwrbtn_to_pch(), since we can check if we are exiting G3 or not, and what we care about here is delaying the power button.",
